B.axR=s(["Konumuna eri\u015femedim. Bir b\xf6lge se\xe7ebilirsin.","I couldn't get your location. You can pick an area."],t.s)
B.aHM=s(['Yumy bu iste\u011fi h\xe2l\xe2 haz\u0131rl\u0131yor. Birazdan "Tekrar dene"ye dokun; ikinci kez say\u0131lmaz.','Yumy is still preparing this request. Tap "Try again" in a moment; it is not counted twice.'],t.s)
B.apY=s(["Plan geziye kaydedilemedi.","The plan couldn't be saved as a trip."],t.s)
B.agw=s(["Plandaki duraklardan hi\xe7biri art\u0131k uygun de\u011fil; gezi olu\u015fturulmad\u0131. Yumy'den yeni bir plan iste.","None of the stops in this plan is available any more; no trip was created. Ask Yumy for a new plan."],t.s)
